# EXAMPLE / REPLACEABLE intent golden set — 52 items across the 9 v1 classes.
# This is a placeholder authored to bootstrap the eval harness. Replace the
# content with your own labelled queries; keep the format. Copy to
# `intent_golden.jsonl` (untracked) for real runs.
#
# Style note: queries are intentionally written the way real users type —
# lowercase, missing Turkish diacritics, no punctuation, abbreviations,
# half-finished thoughts. Do not "clean them up".
#
# Format per line: {"query": str, "expected_intent": <label>, "lang": "tr"}
# Blank lines and lines starting with '#' are ignored.

# 2026-08-27 fix: this set used to label single-product/aggregate PRICE
# queries as product_fact/aggregation -- but `product_fact`/`aggregation`
# route to real SQL retrieval (see config/default.toml [routing.intents]),
# and the `product` table genuinely has list_price/price_break_* columns
# (facts/db/schema_rag.sql), so those queries could surface a real DB price
# figure. That contradicts quote_or_contact's own strategy file (chatbot/
# strategies/quote_or_contact.md: "A price quote is NOT here and must not
# be generated"). All price/delivery/stock/bulk-purchase queries below were
# moved to quote_or_contact to match (see intent_classification/prompt.py's
# matching fix).

